Record user/actor/revision/operation identifiers, activation time, desired-vs-active revision, upstream health, draining calls and failure categories. Bound retained audit history and diagnostics; redact credentials and tool outputs. Acceptance: operators can distinguish failed activation, stale host discovery, lost MCP transport and failed OAuth refresh; authorized user cannot read another user's records.
